    "body": "## Summary\n\nWI4 of the Blog Accuracy & Link-Rot Resilience Program. Citation/format audit + 129 external-link snapshots across 39 legal blog posts. Precedes WI5 (legal-substance re-review \u2014 expert+founder gate).\n\n## Changes\n\n- `blog/_snapshots/` directory (new) \u2014 129 JSON snapshot files\n- `blog/_snapshots/WI4-AUDIT-REPORT.md` (new) \u2014 full audit findings\n\n## Citation Audit Results\n\n- **39/39 posts** have Sources & References section\n- **0 fabricated citations** detected\n- **7 non-whitelisted source domains** (all secondary legal commentary used alongside primary authority)\n- **151 external links** extracted, **129 snapshots** created\n- **101 live (200)**, 23 rate-limited (403 \u2014 law.cornell.edu), 3 dead (404), 2 URL errors\n\n## Primary Source Distribution\n\n| Source | Links | Whitelisted |\n|---|---|---|\n| law.cornell.edu | 54 | \u2705 |\n| irs.gov | 41 | \u2705 |\n| americanbar.org | 26 | \u2705 |\n| federalregister.gov | 9 | \u2705 |\n| Other gov (epa, osha, occ, cms, fdic, ftc, gao, nhtsa, uscourts) | 14 | \u2705 |\n\n## Validation\n\n- `check_blog_link_archival.py --site edglex.com` \u2192 PASS\n\n## Out of Scope\n\n- Legal-substance re-review (WI5 \u2014 expert+founder gate, Domain 23)\n- Content corrections (follow-up per blog-corrections.md)\n- dateModified metadata addition (follow-up)",
