    "body": "Two blog posts referenced images that weren't copied during the 2026-07-29 legal-site consolidation into edglex.com. The `check_website_integrity` validator caught the broken internal src links.\n\n**Files added** (copied from original redirect-only sites):\n- `blog/assets/loophole-finder-pipeline.png` + `.sha256` + `.meta.json` (from findmyloophole.com)\n- `blog/assets/law-gaps-research-pipeline.png` + `.sha256` + `.meta.json` (from lawgaps.com)\n\n**Validation:**\n- `python3 tools/scripts/check_website_integrity.py` \u2192 PASS (0 findings across all 15 sites)\n\nTracking: 5W #143 (website validation rungs)",
